WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.420
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.320
Alchemy

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.320
Shower

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:03.350
Here in Jeonbugwan we record all the stars

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:06.690
There is also one that appeared on your birthday. Do you want to see?

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:08.440
Yes dad

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:10.860
Okay, let's go

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:24.660
Here

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:31.210
My father studied the stars and made notes about them

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:34.670
Because he was a magician who reads the constellations

00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:48.980
Madam!

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:50.230
Madam!

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:02.450
Stay here and don't go out

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.620
If you see your father, run

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.540
Don't let him catch you

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:34.480
Father...

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:49.440
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:51.440
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.440
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, tommo

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.330
I'll give you strength

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:35.540
Will you come with me?

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.510
On the day my father was killed by the four Daeho families,

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:50.060
I followed Jin Moo

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:53.940
I was raised completely cut off from the world.

00:03:54.020 --> 00:03:56.820
in the deep and dangerous valleys of Danhyanggok

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:30.560
I don’t know, I survived because I’m strong,

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:32.850
or strong because she survived

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:40.480
When my past and my father were forgotten

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:43.650
I'm finally back as Naxu

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:50.830
But Naxu is dead

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:54.750
I came back here as Moo Deok

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:58.170
with a helpless owner,

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:02.380
who at the same time is my disinterested student

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:04.800
How much longer do we have to go?

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:06.180
This bracelet weighs a ton

00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:08.300
Teacher, your student is tired

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:11.010
I've had enough. I can't go anymore

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:13.180
I carry all the things!

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:15.890
I am the master and you are my maid

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:17.230
It's your job

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.230
When necessary, I am your teacher,

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:21.530
and the maid, when you please?

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:22.650
Of course

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:28.280
And I didn't know

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:31.280
that there is such a place outside the city

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:35.080
This place is so harsh that you can't even hear an echo here.

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:37.500
Hence the name, Danhyangok

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:44.130
And I hear an echo

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:45.510
It's just a figure of speech!

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:47.010
The name is moronic

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:49.550
I want to eat

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:53.560
I lived over there

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.850
You will eat what I bring

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:59.480
and sleep where you fall asleep after a hard day

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:04.190
What is this? Smells like chicken

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:08.780
- Do they sell chickens here?
-Who will sell chickens here?

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:13.790
You feel it too, right?

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:15.540
I'm telling you it's chicken

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:18.830
I'm sure. I love chicken

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:21.210
How did you get up there?

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:24.000
Someone is frying chicken nearby

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:25.760
Come down. Why did you go there?

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:36.100
Do you see? Chicken

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:39.230
I told you it smells like her. How cool it is here

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:00.670
Why is all this here?

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:03.630
Moo Dok!

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:06.590
There's even a bath here

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:16.970
Moo Deok,

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:21.230
there is a mountain of food and even a place to swim

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:23.480
Master, you had a good home

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:25.820
Was it necessary to scare the student like that?

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:26.730
So strange...

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:30.490
And there is a blanket

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:35.030
So softly. Cute and comfortable

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:37.330
It's all not mine

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:40.660
Someone lives here

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:47.170
Moo Deok,

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:50.630
Shall we eat chicken? She's already well prepared

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:51.880
Moo Deok?

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:59.060
Is this a man?

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:21.960
Come on, stand!

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:25.290
Calm down

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:38.720
good boy

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:40.640
Well trained. Do you live here?

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:42.770
This is not a stray dog

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.020
Where is your master?

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:47.810
Hey fluffy, bring your master

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:52.030
What a smart dog

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:55.700
Who is this?

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:57.240
These can't be Dan Zhu's people

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:00.580
This one doesn't try to hide or hide

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.330
Tea

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:07.460
We are guests, so we can have a cup, right?

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:10.210
Watch what you eat and drink

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:13.050
First we need to check who lives here

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:14.920
Then we'll decide what to do next.

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:16.260
So you really don't know?

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:17.720
What?

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:20.100
There is a dog, flowers everywhere,

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:22.100
chicken and tea is boiling

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:23.480
And I almost made a mistake

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:24.930
What are you talking about?

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:28.310
I decided that you were trying to kidnap me and live with me,

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:29.860
hiding behind training

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:31.730
If this dog would wag his tail at you,

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:34.440
I would think that this is all your plan

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:36.650
There's enough room for two or three kids.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:39.240
Everything was different here when I lived here

00:09:39.820 --> 00:09:41.200
The place was lifeless

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:43.870
and perfect for training, that's why I brought you here

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:46.750
So, training?

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.460
Was this just on your mind?

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:52.590
Forget! Eat and drink what you want, go ahead

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:53.800
Let them kill you

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:56.470
That's right

00:09:56.550 --> 00:10:00.220
I didn't think she would react like that to a simple joke

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:03.470
It's my own fault for following her into this wilderness.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.020
There are no words

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:15.570
Remain a clueless heir

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:19.780
Chan family

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:22.990
I'd rather stay here

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.660
than I will live like this

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:13.840
Today is the head of Jinyeowon

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.750
convened the magicians of Deho at the Unified Council

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:20.760
All 11 families present except Chang Gan

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:24.760
Is my fight with Chan Wook such a big deal?

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:27.770
This is a duel between magicians and the royal family

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:29.640
The last one was hundreds of years ago

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:32.270
I'm just trying to punish Chan Wook

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:34.440
for looking down on me

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:35.900
These are not personal scores

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:39.530
His Majesty gave the order and the magicians gathered

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:43.280
If they agree, an official match will take place

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:47.580
A gap has appeared that has destroyed stability and peace,

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:50.870
existed between the palace and the magicians

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:08.140
Do you really agree with the decision to deprive Wook of his rights to become the next Gwangju?

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:10.730
Yes, it's true

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:16.770
The duel is only

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:19.400
will resolve the misunderstanding between the Crown Prince and Uk

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:20.740
And regarding Gwangju

00:12:21.610 --> 00:12:26.120
I already have a candidate that I want to nominate

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:28.030
Escape does not equal defeat

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:32.410
I heard he ran away before the fight was even announced.

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.000
What a shame

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:39.500
He must fight honestly and die with dignity, like a magician

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:41.840
Chan Wook didn't have the guts to do this

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:46.180
Everyone here was his teacher

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:48.890
- Yes
- He was never distinguished by talent

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:52.480
I am against magicians being disgraced like that

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:55.230
What if we deprive Chan Wook of his status as a magician?

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:01.990
If we unanimously deprive him of this status,

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:05.320
will have to take all his energy, he will lose his strength

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:08.120
Are you proposing to ruin the young man's whole life?

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.030
But this will help sort out the fight

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:15.210
Anyway, the gate of his energy was closed because of his father.

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.210
- He's right
- There is a meaning

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:19.380
Each of you

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:22.590
was Uka's teacher

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:27.340
How can you talk so carelessly

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:30.560
about ruining the life of someone who was once your student?

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:35.690
Sosnovy Bor accepted the terms of the palace

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:38.690
We will accept the shame that may or may not fall

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:42.860
Then let this be an official duel between Sosnovy Bor and the palace

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:45.530
Yes

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:49.990
I heard Uk mastered Ryusu in a very short time

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:53.580
Was he taught by someone from the forest?

00:13:57.250 --> 00:14:00.630
It doesn't matter where he goes, to whom,

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:05.920
there is no teacher for him

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:12.970
The water is nice and clean. Skin has become softer

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:14.350
Maybe it's mineral

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:18.690
Moo Deok, the owner of the house is a very neat person

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:20.270
I don't think he'll come back...

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:24.820
That's it

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:40.880
Sound asleep

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.130
Of course you're tired

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:45.840
We could have walked calmly, but you were in a hurry

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:48.880
You are now Moo Deok, not Nak Soo. You don't have enough strength

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:55.220
How...

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:57.100
Heavy

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:58.730
Stupid

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:01.690
If it was that hard, you should have asked for help.

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:11.030
So soft

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:18.580
I'm the boss

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:21.750
and she is a maid. That's right

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:24.960
I should sleep here

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:40.770
Somehow I feel uncomfortable

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:51.360
Okay

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:05.670
teacher,

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:07.170
good night to you

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:33.400
How inconvenient

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:04.230
You say there's a nomad inside?

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.480
How interesting

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:39.550
Without your help, I wouldn't have recognized her

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:41.220
because there is no malice in her soul

00:17:46.060 --> 00:17:50.150
It's better for you to die at my hands than to become wild and petrified

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:20.760
There's an amazing soul in this body

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:26.480
She should have gone wild by now, considering how weak this body is

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:28.480
Why is she still okay?

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:40.160
I don't feel any energy. Where did she all disappear to?

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.580
Who are you?

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:51.460
Who are you?

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:53.540
Get away from Moo Deok

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:31.390
This sword was given by the King of Gwangju, Jeonbugwan.

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:33.270
Who are you?

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:36.110
What are you doing next to a girl like that?

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:41.240
Moo Deok, run!

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:10.910
Finally woke up

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:16.540
Who is this?

00:22:16.620 --> 00:22:17.920
Yesterday's man

00:22:19.290 --> 00:22:20.540
Yesterday's man?

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:21.840
Yes. Don't remember?

00:22:26.590 --> 00:22:27.840
Moo Deok, run!

00:23:04.090 --> 00:23:05.880
I'm sorry about yesterday

00:23:05.960 --> 00:23:07.800
I saw someone in the house

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:10.890
and you suddenly pulled out a sword, I had no choice

00:23:10.970 --> 00:23:12.300
Yes, I was scared myself

00:23:12.390 --> 00:23:14.970
I still have trouble controlling the energy in my hand

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:16.930
I didn't mean to hurt you

00:23:17.020 --> 00:23:18.140
You two...

00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:20.020
fought?

00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:26.150
Do you really remember nothing?

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:28.610
No

00:23:28.690 --> 00:23:31.240
You stood right there and looked at us

00:23:31.320 --> 00:23:32.570
Me?

00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:33.530
What?

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:35.910
I think you're sleepwalking

00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:39.580
I will give you medicinal herbs for this. Brew tea and drink

00:23:40.210 --> 00:23:41.670
Are you a doctor?

00:23:41.750 --> 00:23:43.830
No, but he's here to collect some herbs,

00:23:43.920 --> 00:23:45.540
which can only be found here

00:23:45.630 --> 00:23:46.550
Call me Master Li

00:23:47.130 --> 00:23:49.300
There's enough room for us here

00:23:49.380 --> 00:23:51.260
feel at home

00:23:54.640 --> 00:23:56.180
Okay, Sapsari

00:23:58.470 --> 00:23:59.850
You really don't remember?

00:23:59.930 --> 00:24:01.940
Did I really sleepwalk?

00:24:15.950 --> 00:24:17.200
I was lying on the floor...

00:24:17.280 --> 00:24:19.750
This nomad is special

00:24:19.830 --> 00:24:23.040
A special soul in such a weak body

00:24:25.330 --> 00:24:27.290
Let's get to know her better

00:24:27.380 --> 00:24:28.840
Don't lie

00:24:28.920 --> 00:24:31.510
Seriously! I shifted you so that you can sleep more comfortably

00:24:31.590 --> 00:24:32.970
What kind of relationship are you in?

00:24:34.720 --> 00:24:35.930
Married?

00:24:36.010 --> 00:24:37.220
- No
- No

00:24:38.180 --> 00:24:41.350
I didn't sleep on the bed. I was lying on the floor

00:24:41.430 --> 00:24:43.480
Why should I lie? I really...

00:24:43.560 --> 00:24:44.850
- You always lie
- Probably married

00:24:45.770 --> 00:24:46.940
- Not at all
- Not at all

00:24:47.520 --> 00:24:49.110
Well, did you win?

00:24:49.190 --> 00:24:50.730
No, I lost. But...

00:24:51.610 --> 00:24:52.990
He is very strong

00:24:53.070 --> 00:24:55.280
- He...
- You're lucky. I knew it

00:24:55.360 --> 00:24:56.410
What?

00:25:00.740 --> 00:25:04.120
They even gathered a council. Things are getting complicated

00:25:04.210 --> 00:25:07.540
Do you think Wook and Moo Deok are okay?

00:25:07.630 --> 00:25:10.300
They went to Sari, Mu Dok's home village

00:25:10.380 --> 00:25:11.550
She's happy, I guess

00:25:13.380 --> 00:25:14.970
Why should she be happy?

00:25:15.050 --> 00:25:16.180
She had to leave you

00:25:16.260 --> 00:25:18.510
- And?
- Well, you're an idiot

00:25:18.600 --> 00:25:20.510
Moo Deok is in love with you

00:25:23.140 --> 00:25:24.520
She said so

00:25:25.440 --> 00:25:26.770
to help Uku

00:25:26.850 --> 00:25:28.560
Yes, yes, of course

00:25:31.570 --> 00:25:34.490
I heard Mr. Chan ran away

00:25:34.570 --> 00:25:38.700
He didn't run away, he just hid for now

00:25:38.780 --> 00:25:40.240
What's the difference?

00:25:40.330 --> 00:25:43.000
So he went to Danhyangok with Moo Deok?

00:25:44.870 --> 00:25:46.960
- Danhyangok?
- Yes

00:25:47.040 --> 00:25:50.420
She recently set off fireworks there on the orders of Mr.

00:25:50.500 --> 00:25:53.090
I remember seeing them

00:25:53.170 --> 00:25:56.260
I found out that they went there because it was close

00:25:56.340 --> 00:25:59.010
- Am I right?
- No

00:25:59.090 --> 00:26:01.970
Moo Dok with Wook in Sari Village

00:26:02.060 --> 00:26:04.060
Oh, I see. Sari

00:26:04.140 --> 00:26:06.270
Don't tell anyone that Uk is there

00:26:06.850 --> 00:26:08.520
Okay, I won't tell

00:26:08.600 --> 00:26:09.730
Bon appetit

00:26:11.900 --> 00:26:14.230
Mu Deok to Danhyangok?

00:26:14.320 --> 00:26:15.820
The place is very dangerous

00:26:15.900 --> 00:26:18.240
Is that where you kept your pet bird?

00:26:18.950 --> 00:26:20.990
You twisted your ankle there and scared everyone

00:26:21.950 --> 00:26:23.370
Yes, in Danhyangok

00:26:25.540 --> 00:26:27.710
I forgot everything about this place

00:26:41.390 --> 00:26:42.510
The fire is weak

00:26:47.560 --> 00:26:50.190
His body is full of energy considering his strength

00:26:53.190 --> 00:26:54.900
He is the master of Chipsu

00:26:55.530 --> 00:26:57.900
Chips? So he's as strong as me

00:26:57.990 --> 00:27:00.360
It's clear why it was so hard to beat him

00:27:09.920 --> 00:27:12.080
It uses energy to keep the fire going

00:27:12.170 --> 00:27:13.250
He moved on

00:27:14.170 --> 00:27:15.300
than Ryusu

00:27:18.010 --> 00:27:18.970
Ryusu?

00:27:20.090 --> 00:27:22.720
He's stronger than me. I could have gotten hurt a lot

00:27:28.020 --> 00:27:29.770
The rain wet my clothes

00:27:51.830 --> 00:27:53.000
This is Chisu

00:27:53.790 --> 00:27:55.710
He dried his clothes so easily

00:27:55.790 --> 00:27:58.420
This is the highest degree of Chisu

00:28:05.220 --> 00:28:06.850
Highest degree?

00:28:08.140 --> 00:28:09.600
I could have died

00:28:13.230 --> 00:28:14.770
Now it's dry

00:28:23.780 --> 00:28:25.120
Don't drink this tea

00:28:29.870 --> 00:28:31.370
Have you drunk everything?

00:28:31.460 --> 00:28:32.460
Yes

00:28:32.540 --> 00:28:34.630
Are you okay? Does anything hurt?

00:28:37.250 --> 00:28:38.300
Is this a poisonous infusion?

00:28:39.210 --> 00:28:40.590
No, of course

00:28:40.670 --> 00:28:41.970
Prutnyak decoction

00:28:42.050 --> 00:28:43.300
Prutnyak?

00:28:43.380 --> 00:28:44.640
Prutnyak decoction?

00:28:45.220 --> 00:28:48.260
You talked about herbs that only grow in Danhyangok

00:28:48.350 --> 00:28:49.680
Were you talking about twigs?

00:28:51.980 --> 00:28:53.810
Do you know about him?

00:28:53.890 --> 00:28:56.860
I heard that magicians drank this tea...

00:28:56.940 --> 00:29:00.280
He lowered libido and they trained calmly

00:29:01.690 --> 00:29:03.360
Libido? What is this?

00:29:04.200 --> 00:29:06.990
Carnal desire, one of the five human needs

00:29:07.070 --> 00:29:08.580
Carnal...

00:29:11.290 --> 00:29:13.370
Prutnyak lowers...

00:29:14.870 --> 00:29:18.090
the energy that causes this desire

00:29:20.300 --> 00:29:23.090
I heard about a magician who reached a high level of witchcraft

00:29:23.170 --> 00:29:25.800
He succeeded because he lowered his libido and improved

00:29:25.880 --> 00:29:29.050
They say he wears only hemp clothes,

00:29:29.140 --> 00:29:32.350
That's why Master Li was nicknamed "Master Hemp Li"

00:29:32.430 --> 00:29:36.140
Are you smart for a simple maid?

00:29:38.770 --> 00:29:41.980
It is an honor for me to meet a magician of such a level

00:29:42.530 --> 00:29:44.490
Greetings, Master HempLi

00:29:53.120 --> 00:29:54.080
owner,

00:29:54.160 --> 00:29:56.080
Why are you sitting? Say hello

00:29:59.210 --> 00:30:02.500
So... my libido is already quite the same?..

00:30:03.880 --> 00:30:05.010
No...

00:30:05.090 --> 00:30:06.090
No...

00:30:06.170 --> 00:30:07.720
Not this...

00:30:08.430 --> 00:30:10.350
This can't happen. Help me

00:30:11.180 --> 00:30:13.930
One kettle is not enough for this

00:30:14.020 --> 00:30:15.850
Are you sure? Tell me the truth!

00:30:15.930 --> 00:30:17.940
This is true. If you're so worried,

00:30:18.020 --> 00:30:20.480
I'll brew another tea that will put everything back in place

00:30:22.440 --> 00:30:25.070
Thank you

00:30:25.150 --> 00:30:26.150
Master Li

00:30:26.240 --> 00:30:28.990
Can you help my master?

00:30:29.070 --> 00:30:33.450
His energy has accumulated in his right hand and he cannot control it

00:30:33.540 --> 00:30:37.460
Can you teach him how to cope?

00:30:37.540 --> 00:30:39.210
It won't be difficult to teach him

00:30:39.290 --> 00:30:42.250
But! To learn from me you have to follow everything I say.

00:30:42.340 --> 00:30:43.550
Are you ready for this?

00:30:43.630 --> 00:30:45.050
He's ready for anything

00:30:45.130 --> 00:30:46.050
Really?

00:30:48.590 --> 00:30:51.350
What exactly do I need to do?

00:30:51.430 --> 00:30:52.550
Like me

00:30:53.350 --> 00:30:54.770
drink a decoction of twig

00:30:56.060 --> 00:30:58.480
Ready to downgrade

00:31:01.150 --> 00:31:02.230
libido?

00:31:06.820 --> 00:31:08.450
Have you emptied the entire kettle?

00:31:08.950 --> 00:31:09.950
Yes

00:31:10.910 --> 00:31:12.120
Can you do it?

00:31:24.040 --> 00:31:26.300
So what if he's a famous magician?

00:31:26.380 --> 00:31:30.090
He doesn't have a student and he's hanging around for no apparent reason.

00:31:30.930 --> 00:31:33.180
With his help everything will go faster

00:31:33.680 --> 00:31:36.430
You will be able to control the energy in your right hand

00:31:36.520 --> 00:31:40.100
Hey, he wants me to drink this chastity tea. What's the point?

00:31:40.190 --> 00:31:44.650
I'm already worried about how much I drank yesterday

00:31:44.730 --> 00:31:47.150
I doubt that this tea will be enough,
to get it all back

00:31:47.230 --> 00:31:49.070
This makes sense

00:31:50.200 --> 00:31:52.160
Not such a bad idea

00:31:52.240 --> 00:31:55.620
Now you don't need increased libido

00:31:59.710 --> 00:32:03.000
So, for some time I won’t have any desires?

00:32:04.960 --> 00:32:06.960
Moo Deok, look me in the eyes and tell me

00:32:07.050 --> 00:32:08.550
Yes! And what?

00:32:08.630 --> 00:32:10.590
Think for yourself. This is a rare opportunity

00:32:10.670 --> 00:32:12.880
Not every fool is lucky enough to meet someone like him

00:32:13.930 --> 00:32:15.550
A little abstinence

00:32:16.600 --> 00:32:17.600
and get rid of it

00:32:17.680 --> 00:32:20.180
This is not a walk in the garden, I don’t need it here!

00:32:20.270 --> 00:32:22.310
Celibacy is an insignificant sacrifice for a high-level magician

00:32:22.390 --> 00:32:24.190
Just listen!

00:32:24.270 --> 00:32:26.730
You don’t care even if I ruin everything for myself there forever!

00:32:26.820 --> 00:32:28.280
Stop making mountains out of molehills!

00:32:28.360 --> 00:32:30.400
It's important to me, whether I use it or not!

00:32:41.620 --> 00:32:43.170
Hey...

00:32:43.250 --> 00:32:45.960
Hey Moo Deok, are you okay?

00:32:46.540 --> 00:32:48.590
What just happened?

00:32:49.630 --> 00:32:50.550
Ryusu

00:32:52.840 --> 00:32:55.260
The energy leaked out of you

00:32:56.760 --> 00:32:59.180
A little energy and such a burst of strength

00:32:59.770 --> 00:33:02.810
If you took off the bracelet and used all your strength,

00:33:02.890 --> 00:33:04.690
I would have died on the spot

00:33:08.440 --> 00:33:09.900
Hey, you're bleeding...

00:33:12.320 --> 00:33:14.320
Teacher, are you completely crazy?

00:33:14.400 --> 00:33:16.410
- Do you like the idea that you could die?
- Yes

00:33:16.490 --> 00:33:19.410
It means you're getting stronger

00:33:23.000 --> 00:33:26.370
It may seem insignificant now,

00:33:26.460 --> 00:33:29.670
but soon you will have more energy

00:33:30.460 --> 00:33:33.840
and your strength will become as impressive as Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake

00:33:35.970 --> 00:33:38.390
Then I too can regain my strength

00:33:52.280 --> 00:33:55.360
Wipe the blood from your forehead before it drenches Gyeongjeongdaeho

00:33:58.780 --> 00:33:59.620
Does it hurt?

00:33:59.700 --> 00:34:01.330
Not at all

00:34:01.410 --> 00:34:02.910
Stop being brave

00:34:07.790 --> 00:34:09.710
First year of King Go San's reign

00:34:09.790 --> 00:34:12.170
April 1st

00:34:18.720 --> 00:34:20.050
Go San, Year One, April 1st

00:34:20.140 --> 00:34:23.600
The King's Star lit up in the night sky on the boy's birthday

00:34:23.680 --> 00:34:26.310
No one should know about this

00:34:26.390 --> 00:34:28.900
But Jeongbugwan probably made a note

00:34:28.980 --> 00:34:31.310
I took out a real sign from there

00:34:31.400 --> 00:34:32.730
In Jeonbugwan

00:34:33.860 --> 00:34:35.490
fake without star

00:34:37.110 --> 00:34:41.320
Don't let anyone know the secret of his birth

00:34:45.950 --> 00:34:48.540
Have you seen a strange constellation?

00:34:57.420 --> 00:35:01.510
It's Wook's birthday and Lady Do Hwa's death.

00:35:04.260 --> 00:35:05.930
I heard about the advice

00:35:06.890 --> 00:35:11.440
All the venerable magicians have gathered because of me

00:35:14.230 --> 00:35:15.530
Deputy of Gwangju,

00:35:16.320 --> 00:35:18.150
why don't you start your genealogy?

00:35:19.200 --> 00:35:21.990
By a single vote,

00:35:22.070 --> 00:35:26.660
you too may be recognized as a venerable magician

00:35:29.370 --> 00:35:32.790
I am from the Jin family. Jinyeowon is the place where I was born

00:35:35.840 --> 00:35:37.710
What brought you to Jeonbugwan?

00:35:37.800 --> 00:35:39.300
The nomad who was found in Sosnovy Bor

00:35:39.380 --> 00:35:41.590
was an astrologer from Jeonbugwan

00:35:42.340 --> 00:35:44.760
The magicians of Jeongjingak began an investigation,

00:35:45.470 --> 00:35:46.680
provide assistance

00:35:47.390 --> 00:35:49.350
What investigation?

00:35:54.110 --> 00:35:58.030
And if I tell you, will you hide all the evidence?

00:36:01.070 --> 00:36:03.620
I have nothing to hide

00:36:03.700 --> 00:36:05.580
They can come anytime

00:36:06.950 --> 00:36:09.660
They're already here

00:36:34.150 --> 00:36:35.940
This magician should have

00:36:36.020 --> 00:36:38.980
constantly maintain the right amount of energy here

00:36:40.030 --> 00:36:42.700
He was responsible for this place

00:36:51.450 --> 00:36:54.670
What? Body in Jeonbugwan?

00:36:54.750 --> 00:36:57.960
Eunuch Kim extracted all his energy, body in secret room

00:37:12.730 --> 00:37:15.100
There was nothing special about his work

00:37:15.190 --> 00:37:18.270
Perhaps a remark for secretly looking at constellation signs

00:37:21.650 --> 00:37:22.690
Uncle

00:37:23.780 --> 00:37:27.160
Many scientists have disappeared here

00:37:27.240 --> 00:37:28.620
Where could they have disappeared to?

00:37:35.370 --> 00:37:37.000
Thanks for your help

00:37:37.670 --> 00:37:39.090
Nothing special

00:37:39.170 --> 00:37:41.420
I have one more request

00:37:42.300 --> 00:37:43.920
Maybe it's too much

00:37:44.720 --> 00:37:48.260
but I would like to take a look at Jeonbugwan's secret room

00:38:06.030 --> 00:38:07.910
You can look around

00:38:34.270 --> 00:38:36.980
Take the body out through the underground passage

00:38:49.200 --> 00:38:52.120
If they hide something they will try to get rid of it

00:38:52.950 --> 00:38:54.580
Keep an eye on his people

00:38:58.670 --> 00:38:59.870
Faster

00:39:13.260 --> 00:39:15.180
We saw this cart leave Jeonbugwan

00:39:15.270 --> 00:39:17.060
Are you magicians?

00:39:17.140 --> 00:39:18.270
Show your faces

00:39:18.350 --> 00:39:19.560
We want to see what's inside

00:40:03.190 --> 00:40:04.110
Let's get him

00:40:52.200 --> 00:40:53.740
The man ran away

00:40:55.110 --> 00:40:56.660
Have you lost it?

00:40:58.870 --> 00:41:00.160
This was inside

00:41:00.790 --> 00:41:02.250
Spirit Amulet

00:41:03.120 --> 00:41:05.210
Are they from Sosnovy Bor?

00:41:20.680 --> 00:41:23.890
There was a spirit amulet in the cart

00:41:23.980 --> 00:41:26.060
There shouldn't be any questions

00:41:27.060 --> 00:41:29.650
Nak Su helped us even after death

00:41:33.150 --> 00:41:36.200
Sorry for the trouble, Deputy Gwangju

00:41:40.910 --> 00:41:43.750
You attacked a man in the middle of the street?

00:41:43.830 --> 00:41:46.670
I transferred your worthless soul to a worthy body,

00:41:46.750 --> 00:41:48.130
but you had no right to show off

00:41:48.210 --> 00:41:49.380
Sorry

00:41:58.050 --> 00:42:00.140
Deliver this chest

00:42:03.310 --> 00:42:05.480
Make sure it gets into the right hands

00:42:05.560 --> 00:42:08.810
I'll take care of it right away

00:42:19.490 --> 00:42:21.410
It's time to get rid of him

00:42:21.490 --> 00:42:23.200
Find me another eunuch

00:42:23.290 --> 00:42:27.370
Or I'll move your soul into his body

00:42:30.380 --> 00:42:32.050
In the body of a eunuch?

00:42:32.960 --> 00:42:35.720
What? Don't like it?

00:42:38.550 --> 00:42:40.850
I'll follow your order

00:42:40.930 --> 00:42:44.020
Do you still carry the Reflector with you?

00:42:44.100 --> 00:42:45.020
Yes

00:42:53.650 --> 00:42:57.070
I was thinking about refraining from transmigrating souls because of Sosnovy Bor

00:42:58.820 --> 00:43:02.990
But apparently this is the only way to serve His Majesty

00:43:08.710 --> 00:43:12.090
The Sosnovy Bor amulet was found in a strange cart,

00:43:12.170 --> 00:43:14.250
who left Jeonbugwan

00:43:14.340 --> 00:43:17.220
Now we have no right to look for anything there

00:43:17.300 --> 00:43:20.180
Find out whose amulet it is

00:43:20.760 --> 00:43:24.720
Remember, Uk lost his

00:43:25.310 --> 00:43:28.730
And judging by this burnt mark, this is his amulet

00:43:30.100 --> 00:43:31.400
Amulet of Uka?

00:43:31.480 --> 00:43:35.610
Just think, he escaped, but problems still fall on us

00:43:35.690 --> 00:43:37.440
Find Uka

00:43:37.530 --> 00:43:41.450
Find out how and where he lost it

00:43:42.280 --> 00:43:43.570
- Yes
- Yes

00:44:24.410 --> 00:44:26.700
This is from Jin Moo, Jeonbugwan's deputy

00:44:36.670 --> 00:44:39.800
What does he always send you?

00:44:40.550 --> 00:44:43.840
These are medicinal herbs for my health

00:44:46.850 --> 00:44:49.140
You can't tell by him, but he's very caring.

00:45:04.110 --> 00:45:05.030
Moo Deok

00:45:05.110 --> 00:45:07.700
Master Li and I will go collect herbs

00:45:07.780 --> 00:45:08.830
What about training?

00:45:08.910 --> 00:45:11.830
I have to pay for maintenance. See you later

00:45:11.910 --> 00:45:13.290
- Let's go
- Yes

00:45:14.370 --> 00:45:15.960
Is it really that beautiful there?

00:45:16.040 --> 00:45:18.840
- Simply amazing
- I wish I could see you soon

00:45:24.180 --> 00:45:26.550
Master Li, you are so clever

00:45:26.640 --> 00:45:29.430
I buy everything and put it away. Hold it

00:45:29.510 --> 00:45:30.560
- So?
- Yes

00:45:34.890 --> 00:45:36.060
Great

00:45:38.650 --> 00:45:41.360
Today we'll go to a place full of tangerines*

00:45:38.650 --> 00:45:41.360
*Chinese perch

00:45:41.440 --> 00:45:44.700
Mandarin ducks? Let's take what we need and prepare fish stew

00:45:44.780 --> 00:45:46.110
Can you do it?

00:45:46.200 --> 00:45:48.160
No, but you will teach me

00:45:49.080 --> 00:45:50.910
What's wrong with you...

00:46:02.130 --> 00:46:03.260
Oversalted

00:46:05.970 --> 00:46:07.640
Moo Deok, try it

00:46:08.220 --> 00:46:11.100
Master, are you here to deal with nonsense?

00:46:11.180 --> 00:46:12.930
What are you doing?

00:46:13.720 --> 00:46:15.890
There's a lot to learn from Master Li

00:46:15.980 --> 00:46:17.400
Who is asking you to learn this?

00:46:17.480 --> 00:46:19.480
If you learn from him, learn correctly!

00:46:20.310 --> 00:46:22.860
Moo Deok, I think I'm perfect for this kind of life.

00:46:22.940 --> 00:46:24.570
Thank you for bringing me

00:46:24.650 --> 00:46:26.240
to such a wonderful place

00:46:28.820 --> 00:46:29.990
You're not worried

00:46:32.120 --> 00:46:34.200
because of the fight with the prince?

00:46:35.620 --> 00:46:37.670
If you're so worried, figure it out yourself

00:46:39.630 --> 00:46:40.580
I definitely oversalted it

00:46:43.750 --> 00:46:44.670
Hey!

00:46:56.560 --> 00:46:57.770
Moo Deok, put down the knife

00:46:58.730 --> 00:47:00.650
Don't you dare throw it at me!

00:47:01.230 --> 00:47:03.360
I said I'll kill you if you're useless

00:47:04.480 --> 00:47:05.570
You can't kill me

00:47:05.650 --> 00:47:07.820
I mastered Chipsu, and you are just Moo Dok

00:47:09.740 --> 00:47:11.450
You are not Nak Soo anymore

00:47:14.120 --> 00:47:15.790
Hey, he said it!

00:47:16.500 --> 00:47:19.330
You and I don't need peace and tranquility

00:47:19.420 --> 00:47:20.620
I'll destroy your world

00:47:27.130 --> 00:47:28.510
What's wrong with you?

00:47:28.590 --> 00:47:30.720
Why are you stopping me from living peacefully?

00:47:30.800 --> 00:47:32.680
Are you satisfied with this life?

00:47:33.930 --> 00:47:34.810
Yes!

00:47:34.890 --> 00:47:37.810
Absolutely. If you don't like it, leave

00:47:37.890 --> 00:47:39.810
I like living here

00:47:39.890 --> 00:47:42.860
and you can leave if you are so against it

00:47:45.190 --> 00:47:46.530
Scumbag

00:47:47.570 --> 00:47:49.740
You know that we are connected by fate

00:47:50.280 --> 00:47:52.530
And you want me to finish everything

00:47:54.370 --> 00:47:55.660
Coward

00:48:26.900 --> 00:48:28.690
I found a way for Uka

00:48:28.780 --> 00:48:32.490
avoid the duel and become Jeonbugwan's gwangju

00:48:33.490 --> 00:48:36.200
Which one? We are ready for anything

00:48:37.580 --> 00:48:41.830
Let him marry my daughter Cho Young

00:48:49.590 --> 00:48:52.050
Our family has an amulet that will allow

00:48:52.130 --> 00:48:53.970
refuse the king's orders

00:48:59.060 --> 00:49:01.640
We might even overthrow the king

00:49:01.730 --> 00:49:05.060
if all Daeho mages vote for this

00:49:06.020 --> 00:49:09.860
This amulet was entrusted to us by the United Council

00:49:09.940 --> 00:49:14.490
to prevent the escape of evil spirits that are sealed in Jinyeowon

00:49:15.070 --> 00:49:19.790
You propose to cancel the king's order to deprive Uka of his rights

00:49:20.370 --> 00:49:21.750
become the next Gwangju?

00:49:21.830 --> 00:49:24.290
Yes, but only if he marries my daughter

00:49:24.920 --> 00:49:26.790
and join the Jin family

00:49:30.590 --> 00:49:34.300
But Mrs. Jin and Mr. Wook once

00:49:35.430 --> 00:49:38.300
The engagement has already been broken. Is this not a problem?

00:49:39.720 --> 00:49:41.930
It wasn't because my feelings for him had passed

00:49:42.600 --> 00:49:45.020
I still want to marry Uka

00:49:49.400 --> 00:49:51.730
I didn't think he'd get married early

00:49:51.820 --> 00:49:53.900
And I'm not sure he's ready to get married

00:50:03.660 --> 00:50:06.580
You're doing good for a rich man's son

00:50:06.670 --> 00:50:09.790
Once I get excited about something, I learn quickly

00:50:09.880 --> 00:50:11.090
Now I like you even more

00:50:12.760 --> 00:50:15.380
Reconsider your desire to become my student

00:50:16.380 --> 00:50:19.430
Master, haven’t you had a single student?

00:50:21.140 --> 00:50:22.890
There was one

00:50:22.970 --> 00:50:24.980
but he gave up celibacy and got married

00:50:26.940 --> 00:50:28.850
He now works in a hospital

00:50:36.530 --> 00:50:38.860
You can change your mind and refuse at any time

00:50:38.950 --> 00:50:40.070
Think about it

00:50:41.950 --> 00:50:44.200
I didn't come here for training.

00:50:44.290 --> 00:50:46.080
Do you really want to spend this power?

00:50:46.160 --> 00:50:48.830
for fishing and collecting herbs?

00:50:54.090 --> 00:50:57.050
- I still don’t control her
- Yes?

00:50:57.720 --> 00:51:00.220
This hand will become a burden if you leave it like this

00:51:01.890 --> 00:51:03.640
Do you want me to take all the energy?

00:51:05.600 --> 00:51:08.690
Then you can live a normal life

00:51:23.700 --> 00:51:26.450
I'm going to town. Will you come with me?

00:51:26.540 --> 00:51:29.460
No, not today. I have to cook Moo Deok to eat

00:51:30.670 --> 00:51:33.710
She's not here. She recently went down the mountain

00:51:34.920 --> 00:51:36.050
What?

00:51:36.130 --> 00:51:38.970
Chan Wook is just a genius

00:51:39.050 --> 00:51:41.340
He has already mastered Ryusu

00:51:41.430 --> 00:51:44.010
and is training hard for the fight

00:51:46.140 --> 00:51:48.560
Let such a rumor spread throughout the city

00:51:48.640 --> 00:51:49.690
Seriously?

00:51:50.390 --> 00:51:53.150
If he doesn't show up, he'll lose face completely.

00:51:54.190 --> 00:51:57.320
So at least he will feel humiliated

00:51:58.030 --> 00:51:59.280
Give me some chicken

00:51:59.360 --> 00:52:01.950
Leave today. Here are the people of Jeonbugwan

00:52:02.030 --> 00:52:03.990
Someone important came today

00:52:05.080 --> 00:52:06.790
It's better not to cross paths with him.

00:52:06.870 --> 00:52:08.410
especially after the story with the amulet

00:52:29.390 --> 00:52:30.270
Come on, stand!

00:52:35.440 --> 00:52:37.690
Are you Chan Wook's maid?

00:52:38.780 --> 00:52:40.570
Yes. And what?

00:52:41.360 --> 00:52:44.780
Nak Soo would never transfer her soul into such a body.

00:52:45.950 --> 00:52:46.990
Hey you

00:52:47.660 --> 00:52:51.040
Do you remember we met at the inn by the pier?

00:53:01.050 --> 00:53:02.840
I don't even know

00:53:06.970 --> 00:53:08.260
He suspects me

00:53:09.390 --> 00:53:12.350
I want to ask you a couple of questions. Come with us to Jeonbugwan

00:53:15.770 --> 00:53:16.810
Let's go

00:53:16.900 --> 00:53:18.980
- Let me go
- Stand still

00:53:19.070 --> 00:53:20.480
- Why do you...
- Well, stand

00:53:22.900 --> 00:53:24.030
She doesn't have a blue mark

00:53:25.570 --> 00:53:27.450
She's right isn't Nak Soo?

00:53:29.370 --> 00:53:32.580
I don't know where the owner is

00:53:36.130 --> 00:53:37.330
Your Highness

00:53:41.210 --> 00:53:42.420
Your Highness

00:53:43.550 --> 00:53:45.220
Your Highness, it's me

00:53:45.300 --> 00:53:46.680
It's me, Won Moo Deok

00:53:59.310 --> 00:54:00.730
You're Won Moo Deok

00:54:00.820 --> 00:54:04.240
Yes, it's me. You gave me this name

00:54:04.320 --> 00:54:05.860
I am Won Moo Deok

00:54:08.070 --> 00:54:10.950
Your Highness, please help me

00:54:11.030 --> 00:54:12.160
With what?

00:54:12.750 --> 00:54:15.870
Your Highness, you are not just smart, but also very strong

00:54:15.960 --> 00:54:18.210
And my master, on the contrary, is stupid and pathetic

00:54:18.290 --> 00:54:20.090
Because of him my life is in danger

00:54:20.170 --> 00:54:21.920
Please help me

00:54:28.430 --> 00:54:30.970
Thank you very much, Your Highness

00:54:33.060 --> 00:54:35.890
What is your stupid and pathetic owner doing?

00:54:35.980 --> 00:54:38.190
He just cries every day

00:54:38.270 --> 00:54:41.320
He's so afraid of you that he's shaking with fear.

00:54:41.400 --> 00:54:43.150
and cries secretly

00:54:43.940 --> 00:54:46.820
I see that you speak badly of him to please me

00:54:47.740 --> 00:54:51.240
I can say worse things if it makes you happy

00:54:52.410 --> 00:54:56.000
Won Moo Deok, you must think I'm pathetic

00:54:56.580 --> 00:54:58.500
You didn't give me this name for nothing.

00:54:59.080 --> 00:55:02.380
You can tell me everything you wanted, but couldn't,

00:55:02.460 --> 00:55:04.210
because they were afraid to seem pathetic

00:55:05.380 --> 00:55:07.670
Do you want to be a verbal cesspool?

00:55:07.760 --> 00:55:10.510
This is too high a title for me

00:55:10.590 --> 00:55:12.390
But it would be an honor for me

00:55:14.470 --> 00:55:16.810
I don't need you to relieve stress

00:55:18.480 --> 00:55:21.480
Your Highness, you have already done enough,

00:55:21.560 --> 00:55:24.980
but couldn't you order those people not to take me?

00:55:25.650 --> 00:55:27.110
A warning will suffice

00:55:35.040 --> 00:55:36.370
Take this

00:55:37.830 --> 00:55:39.040
This is my sachet

00:55:39.120 --> 00:55:40.290
Sachet - paper or fabric pad (bag) with loose fragrant filling

00:55:40.370 --> 00:55:43.670
Show it if your pathetic boss gets you into trouble again.

00:55:44.630 --> 00:55:47.010
Thank you very much

00:55:52.970 --> 00:55:54.810
It smells like cinnamon

00:55:54.890 --> 00:55:56.680
Why do you have such a face?

00:55:56.770 --> 00:55:58.850
What? Don't you like it?

00:55:58.930 --> 00:56:01.480
No, I really like it

00:56:02.190 --> 00:56:03.690
- If you don’t like it, return it
- No

00:56:03.770 --> 00:56:05.820
I've already stained it with myself

00:56:07.150 --> 00:56:09.860
I thank you for this wonderful smelling gift.

00:56:11.780 --> 00:56:14.910
Let me pour you a drink that smells just as good

00:56:25.170 --> 00:56:26.590
This is a wine with cinnamon and ginger.

00:56:26.670 --> 00:56:27.960
There's a lot of cinnamon in there

00:56:30.050 --> 00:56:32.550
You probably don't like it. Return the sachet

00:56:33.180 --> 00:56:34.180
No

00:56:34.260 --> 00:56:35.470
Like

00:56:45.560 --> 00:56:47.860
- Is it delicious?
- Very

00:56:47.940 --> 00:56:48.900
Have another drink

00:56:56.990 --> 00:56:59.870
Moo Deok probably went to Jwisungra. She has nowhere else to go

00:57:00.410 --> 00:57:02.160
Did she get angry and leave?

00:57:03.250 --> 00:57:04.830
What kind of maid is this?

00:57:05.500 --> 00:57:07.130
She's not just a maid

00:57:07.750 --> 00:57:11.090
If she's not just a servant, then who?

00:57:12.010 --> 00:57:14.430
Moo Deok is like an egg

00:57:14.510 --> 00:57:16.140
She needs to be protected

00:57:17.140 --> 00:57:19.720
- Let's go see
- What's there?

00:57:19.810 --> 00:57:21.930
They found the corpse of a nomad

00:57:22.020 --> 00:57:23.810
- The corpse of a nomad?
- Where?

00:57:26.770 --> 00:57:29.570
- Let me take a look
- What happened?

00:57:29.650 --> 00:57:31.440
- Holy Heavens
- Horror

00:57:31.530 --> 00:57:34.360
Nightmare

00:57:38.280 --> 00:57:40.290
This is not a nomad

00:57:40.370 --> 00:57:42.290
But he died because of him

00:57:43.000 --> 00:57:44.500
Do you know about nomads?

00:57:44.580 --> 00:57:47.130
When nomads lose their minds, they absorb people's energy

00:57:47.710 --> 00:57:49.670
That is why soul alchemy was banned,

00:57:49.750 --> 00:57:52.130
and the nomads began to be caught and killed

00:58:03.680 --> 00:58:05.600
Are all the nomads losing their minds?

00:58:05.690 --> 00:58:07.940
Only those who don't own Hwangsu

00:58:08.650 --> 00:58:11.820
Can a person reach such a level?

00:58:11.900 --> 00:58:13.110
Of course

00:58:13.990 --> 00:58:17.280
Do you want to become my student and reach this level?

00:58:17.860 --> 00:58:20.490
You are not only smart and well built,

00:58:20.580 --> 00:58:22.450
you have everything you need for this

00:58:23.370 --> 00:58:26.790
Thanks for the compliment, but I don't want to take a vow of celibacy

00:58:26.870 --> 00:58:28.080
If you become my student,

00:58:28.170 --> 00:58:30.670
I will help you take off this bracelet

00:58:31.250 --> 00:58:32.340
"Teacher"

00:58:33.920 --> 00:58:34.760
Repeat

00:58:35.670 --> 00:58:37.590
Please stop trying to persuade me

00:58:38.180 --> 00:58:40.680
We are from Jeonbugwan, make way

00:58:42.810 --> 00:58:45.680
I need to go. I can't get in their sight

00:59:00.530 --> 00:59:02.280
Look there

00:59:02.370 --> 00:59:03.910
- Is this a rainbow?
- Where?

00:59:03.990 --> 00:59:06.620
It's a rainbow

00:59:06.710 --> 00:59:09.040
- It's really a rainbow
- Beauty

00:59:09.120 --> 00:59:12.210
- Take a look
- How long has she been gone?

00:59:13.380 --> 00:59:14.760
- Beauty
- Take a look

00:59:14.840 --> 00:59:17.130
- It really is a rainbow
-Where did the cart go?

00:59:18.130 --> 00:59:19.720
She was here a minute ago

00:59:20.260 --> 00:59:23.060
-Where did she go?
-Where is the cart?

00:59:52.580 --> 00:59:55.170
It's amazing to hear your echo in Danhyangok

00:59:57.050 --> 00:59:58.170
Excellent

01:00:01.130 --> 01:00:04.220
What? Is Moo Deok drunk?

01:00:04.300 --> 01:00:06.350
You say she was drinking here?

01:00:06.430 --> 01:00:08.600
Today they almost took her to Jeonbugwan

01:00:09.560 --> 01:00:12.560
But fortunately, the Crown Prince saved her

01:00:14.900 --> 01:00:16.360
- Crown Prince?
- Yes

01:00:16.440 --> 01:00:18.150
She was good at making him laugh

01:00:18.240 --> 01:00:19.820
She found an approach to him

01:00:19.900 --> 01:00:22.820
She drank all the glasses he offered her

01:00:28.040 --> 01:00:28.950
Where is she?

01:00:57.770 --> 01:00:59.690
Drunk as hell

01:01:00.820 --> 01:01:02.860
Moo Deok, are you okay?

01:01:06.450 --> 01:01:09.370
My student, you came for me

01:01:11.250 --> 01:01:13.750
Yes, I came for you, teacher

01:01:15.040 --> 01:01:17.790
I have no control over my body

01:01:18.380 --> 01:01:20.460
I can't even hold my head straight

01:01:21.010 --> 01:01:24.130
This never happened before, no matter how much I drank.

01:01:25.840 --> 01:01:27.800
You are no longer a skilled warrior,

01:01:28.930 --> 01:01:30.100
just Moo Deok

01:01:37.360 --> 01:01:39.940
I can't even drink

01:02:01.250 --> 01:02:03.880
I want to leave everything and lead a quiet life

01:02:06.720 --> 01:02:08.300
But something bothers me

01:02:34.790 --> 01:02:37.370
Thought I fell from a great height

01:02:39.080 --> 01:02:40.960
But I guess it wasn't that high

01:02:50.510 --> 01:02:51.930
Looks like I broke my leg

01:02:52.510 --> 01:02:53.720
Help me

01:02:54.470 --> 01:02:58.310
I saw you use it to call your bird

01:03:00.730 --> 01:03:02.020
I want to try too

01:03:02.110 --> 01:03:04.530
Can I take it?

01:03:19.960 --> 01:03:21.790
I've come to give it back to you

01:03:53.910 --> 01:03:55.490
Moo Deok

01:03:55.780 --> 01:03:56.950
I saw Moo Deok

01:04:02.240 --> 01:04:03.740
She's really here

01:04:04.830 --> 01:04:05.660
Where is Uk?

01:04:06.450 --> 01:04:07.910
I told you not to run

01:04:09.920 --> 01:04:11.250
What is it?

01:04:11.330 --> 01:04:12.540
Why are you here?

01:04:12.630 --> 01:04:14.550
We didn't find you in the village of Sari,

01:04:14.630 --> 01:04:17.130
that's why we came here to look for you

01:04:17.720 --> 01:04:19.800
Joo Wol was right, you are really here

01:04:19.880 --> 01:04:22.300
How are you doing, Moo Deok?

01:04:23.260 --> 01:04:24.430
Okay

01:04:50.000 --> 01:04:52.960
Moo Deok, you're probably glad to see us

01:04:56.340 --> 01:04:57.300
She's drunk

01:04:58.420 --> 01:05:00.050
Did she drink?

01:05:00.130 --> 01:05:01.680
- Yes
- Saw

01:05:02.260 --> 01:05:03.600
Help her up

01:05:04.180 --> 01:05:05.180
Pick her up

01:05:14.980 --> 01:05:17.400
Mu Deok used to come to Danhyangok to collect medicinal herbs

01:05:17.480 --> 01:05:20.700
Master Li lives here, he allowed us to stay here

01:05:20.780 --> 01:05:23.160
I can't believe Moo Deok got drunk alone

01:05:23.240 --> 01:05:24.570
She's doing well

01:05:25.240 --> 01:05:27.330
I didn't know there was such a place in Danhyangok

01:05:27.950 --> 01:05:29.330
Did you know about Danhyangok?

01:05:29.410 --> 01:05:31.580
He used to come here often

01:05:31.660 --> 01:05:34.540
He got it for constantly running away

01:05:34.630 --> 01:05:35.710
Yul?

01:05:36.210 --> 01:05:38.340
He was crazy about birds

01:05:38.420 --> 01:05:40.880
Why did you come here alone?

01:05:40.970 --> 01:05:42.470
You even hurt your leg here

01:05:45.090 --> 01:05:46.720
Because I wanted to see them

01:05:51.430 --> 01:05:53.350
The broken leg didn't bother me

01:05:54.400 --> 01:05:56.230
And I wasn't afraid that they would scold me

01:05:59.650 --> 01:06:01.490
I loved them very much

01:06:16.670 --> 01:06:19.130
He really likes birds

01:06:19.960 --> 01:06:22.760
By the way, what kind of tea is this?

01:06:22.840 --> 01:06:25.510
- The smell is very pleasant
- What did you drink?

01:06:27.930 --> 01:06:30.060
Yes, but what? Is he useful?

01:06:31.060 --> 01:06:31.930
Of course

01:06:32.020 --> 01:06:34.020
It is made from medicinal herbs,

01:06:34.100 --> 01:06:36.520
which grow only in Danhyangok

01:06:36.600 --> 01:06:37.690
Really?

01:06:37.770 --> 01:06:39.860
- Yulia, you try too...
- Don't drink...

01:06:40.360 --> 01:06:41.400
Okay, help yourself

01:06:41.480 --> 01:06:43.740
- The smell is really pleasant
- Tell me?

01:06:46.200 --> 01:06:47.780
This is chastity tea

01:06:49.200 --> 01:06:50.240
What? Chastity?

01:06:50.330 --> 01:06:52.910
You won't be able to...

01:06:54.620 --> 01:06:57.540
- Is this buttercup tea?
- I don’t know exactly

01:06:58.210 --> 01:06:59.250
Well...

01:06:59.340 --> 01:07:02.260
There are a lot of different herbs you can drink

01:07:04.050 --> 01:07:05.050
Delicious

01:07:08.760 --> 01:07:10.260
To your health

01:07:41.460 --> 01:07:43.670
A bunch of suspicious men and my amulet?

01:07:44.260 --> 01:07:45.130
Yes

01:07:45.210 --> 01:07:47.130
Have you really lost your amulet?

01:07:47.220 --> 01:07:49.550
Did someone steal it from you or did you lend it to someone?

01:07:49.640 --> 01:07:51.850
No, I lost it

01:07:51.930 --> 01:07:54.470
Do you remember where and when this happened?

01:07:56.310 --> 01:07:57.140
No

01:07:57.230 --> 01:07:59.730
We found him while investigating the nomad case.

01:07:59.810 --> 01:08:01.650
This is very important and dangerous

01:08:09.660 --> 01:08:13.030
Jin Jo Young and Chan Wook's wedding?

01:08:13.620 --> 01:08:16.160
Great idea

01:08:16.250 --> 01:08:20.460
But those who marry must love each other

01:08:20.540 --> 01:08:24.250
He can't marry someone he doesn't love just to solve the problem.

01:08:24.340 --> 01:08:28.220
Who would talk about love! All my life I am like a lonely tree in a field. Both!

01:08:29.090 --> 01:08:31.800
Wedding is no joke

01:08:31.890 --> 01:08:33.430
I've felt love too

01:08:33.510 --> 01:08:34.600
One day

01:08:34.680 --> 01:08:38.350
I turned away from the master because of love

01:08:38.430 --> 01:08:40.980
And it was all in vain

01:08:41.060 --> 01:08:42.190
Let's hurry up

01:08:42.980 --> 01:08:43.940
getting them married

01:08:49.360 --> 01:08:51.110
An unknown person has destroyed our barrier and entered

01:08:55.830 --> 01:08:59.290
Ho Yeom, come out and say hello

01:08:59.370 --> 01:09:03.170
Who dares call me by name?

01:09:07.960 --> 01:09:09.010
Yeom

01:09:10.260 --> 01:09:11.590
How are you doing?

01:09:12.640 --> 01:09:13.550
Teacher...

01:09:14.390 --> 01:09:15.430
teacher

01:09:16.140 --> 01:09:17.180
Teacher!

01:09:18.720 --> 01:09:19.730
Teacher...

01:09:19.810 --> 01:09:21.770
My teacher

01:09:24.940 --> 01:09:26.820
Put down your swords! Now!

01:09:49.550 --> 01:09:50.720
Moo Deok

01:09:51.510 --> 01:09:54.300
Thought you were sleeping. Searched everywhere

01:09:54.390 --> 01:09:56.220
Are you still drunk?

01:09:56.930 --> 01:09:59.520
Drunk thought I could climb on it

01:10:00.640 --> 01:10:04.150
But it's high here. I think I'm coming to my senses

01:10:04.810 --> 01:10:07.770
Is that the tree with the nest on top?

01:10:07.860 --> 01:10:08.900
Yes

01:10:10.360 --> 01:10:12.400
I want to climb this tree again

01:10:13.780 --> 01:10:17.200
Did you really climb all the way to the top?

01:10:18.410 --> 01:10:20.160
I was Nak Soo then

01:10:21.790 --> 01:10:24.750
The moon from there is simply incredible

01:10:26.000 --> 01:10:28.290
But I won't see her again

01:10:30.420 --> 01:10:32.510
I ran into Dan Zhu's man today

01:10:33.170 --> 01:10:34.680
It seems he suspected me

01:10:35.590 --> 01:10:38.300
Did you give them my spirit amulet?

01:10:38.390 --> 01:10:40.600
I tried to get back with his help

01:10:41.390 --> 01:10:44.060
But he killed the one he mistook for me

01:10:47.060 --> 01:10:49.110
If they catch me

01:10:50.020 --> 01:10:51.360
don't you dare save me

01:10:53.400 --> 01:10:55.490
Of course. I'm too weak anyway

01:10:57.820 --> 01:11:00.580
Your student can't do anything for you

01:11:04.120 --> 01:11:05.500
I didn't expect anything

01:11:09.210 --> 01:11:10.290
Moo Deok,

01:11:10.960 --> 01:11:13.880
I can't do much, but I can climb a tree

01:11:14.760 --> 01:11:17.550
There are no branches above to stand on

01:11:18.550 --> 01:11:20.600
We need to use energy to create a foothold.

01:11:21.220 --> 01:11:23.680
To do this you need to master Chisa

01:11:24.310 --> 01:11:26.020
You care about this like you care about the moon

01:11:26.100 --> 01:11:27.900
I didn't want to do anything

01:11:28.690 --> 01:11:30.520
but I want to climb this tree

01:11:36.950 --> 01:11:38.740
You said you wanted to look at the moon from there

01:11:38.820 --> 01:11:40.990
I'm the only one who can help with this

01:11:41.580 --> 01:11:42.990
so I'll try

01:11:44.040 --> 01:11:45.620
Do you want to go up?

01:11:47.710 --> 01:11:50.670
We need to master Chisa, I told you

01:11:52.380 --> 01:11:53.920
Do you want it or not?

01:11:59.220 --> 01:12:00.970
Then help me

01:12:02.220 --> 01:12:03.720
go up there

01:12:05.730 --> 01:12:06.980
Okay

01:12:07.060 --> 01:12:10.310
I'll take you to the top of this tree

01:12:26.240 --> 01:12:40.620
/////////////////////////////////////

01:12:34.240 --> 01:12:48.620
Thanks for watching with us!
Space for your advertising!

01:12:50.460 --> 01:12:53.460
Alchemy

01:12:50.460 --> 01:12:53.460
Shower

01:12:53.690 --> 01:12:56.780
How's Uka doing?

01:12:56.860 --> 01:12:59.530
Do you know who my real father is?

01:12:59.610 --> 01:13:02.240
Nobody expects you to fight him

01:13:02.320 --> 01:13:05.450
The next step could bring him closer to death

01:13:05.530 --> 01:13:07.660
Does your master know about this?

01:13:07.750 --> 01:13:10.830
Did you meet Nak Soo as a child?

01:13:10.920 --> 01:13:12.290
I don't know her name or age

01:13:12.380 --> 01:13:14.250
Just the place where we looked at the birds

01:13:14.340 --> 01:13:15.880
I don't know where she lived

01:13:15.960 --> 01:13:18.130
This is where the Jin family lives

01:13:18.210 --> 01:13:20.970
Lady Jin's daughter is getting married

01:13:21.050 --> 01:13:23.840
What should I do, teacher? Marry?

01:13:23.930 --> 01:13:26.640
It's not my plan to be your maid forever
